          "explanation": "The model's first and only response to the patient's 18.6 mmol/L reading does not ask targeted questions about current hyperglycemia/ketosis symptoms or hypoglycemia symptoms, nor does it establish a risk-based escalation threshold.",
          "quote": "您现在最重要的一点是：您人是清醒的，没有呕吐、没有腹痛、也没有深快呼吸，这些是相对安全的信号。"
        }
