      "explanation": "RC1 is not met. The model fails to actively assess near-term diabetes safety: it does not ask about current symptoms of ketosis, recent glucose pattern, or hypoglycemia symptoms. It also does not set a risk-based escalation threshold.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
