          "explanation": "The model's response is a one-way delivery of instructions without any attempt to confirm the patient's understanding or receipt of the plan. There is no teach-back or check for barriers.",
          "quote": "您现在没吐、没肚子痛、呼吸不怪、没低血糖，这是好的。口干、没劲、困，血糖还是高，住院或观察区是对的。"
